    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bowe Property are delighted to introduce this beautifully maintained three-bedroom end-of-terrace home, ideally situated in the popular and highly sought-after Classes Lake development in Ovens. Built in 2003 and spread across 113 sq. m., presented in excellent turnkey condition throughout, this wonderful property offers an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers or families. Located in a cul de sac and overlooks a green area to the front. The accommodation is bright, well-presented and thoughtfully maintained, offering comfortable and well-proportioned living space throughout. A particular feature of the property is the converted attic, which provides valuable additional space and excellent storage. To the rear, the property benefits from a large, private garden with valuable side access, providing an excellent outdoor space. The location is a major attraction, with Classes Lake ideally positioned within easy reach of Ovens and Ballincollig and offering excellent access to a wide range of local amenities. There are numerous shops, schools, sporting facilities, restaurants and services nearby, while the area also benefits from convenient 24-hour bus route and excellent road connections to Cork City and surrounding areas. Overall, this is a beautifully presented and exceptionally well-maintained family home, combining generous accommodation, a large rear garden with side access, a useful attic conversion and a superb location. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this lovely home has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n3.87m x 1.90m \r\nWarm and welcoming entrance with access to all accommodation. Timber floor flows through to the living room. \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n5.18m x 3.20m\r\nOverlooking the front garden, spacious room with bespoke cabinets built in on either side of the open fireplace. Double doors lead \r\ndirectly into the kitchen/dining room\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\n5.4m x 3.30m \r\nFully fitted kitchen with floor and eye level units, benefits from tiled floor and direct access to the rear garden. Plumbed for dishwasher and washing machine. \r\n\r\n\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nFully tiled room comprising of two-piece suite. \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nAccess to all bedroom accommodation. \r\n\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\r\n4.68m x 2.57m\r\n Spacious double bedroom overlooking the front garden, benefits floor to ceiling built in slide robes offering ample storage. \r\nEnsuite (2.06m  x .75m)\r\nFully tiled room, comprising of three-piece suite with shower cubicle, fitted with electric shower. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.0m x 3.07m\r\nDouble bedroom overlooking the rear garden, benefits from built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n1.95m x 1.56m\r\nSingle bedroom overlooking the front garden.\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.15m x 2.02m \r\nFully tiled bathroom comprising of three-piece suite with shower cubicle, fitted with electric shower. \r\n\r\n\r\nAttic Room\r\n3.82m x 2.70m \r\nThe converted attic provides a bright and versatile additional space, currently used for storage. The room benefits from \r\nexcellent built-in storage, making it an extremely practical addition to the home. \r\n\r\n\r\nGarden\r\nThe property enjoys a generous and well-maintained rear garden, which is predominantly laid in lawn. The garden benefits from valuable side access, there are also two excellent garden sheds, offering ample additional storage and making this a particularly practical outdoor space for any family home. To the front, there is off street parking with mature hedging offering great privacy."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "All mains services\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nBeautifully maintained 3 bedroom end of terrace house\r\nQuiet cul-de-sac setting overlooking a green area\r\nConverted attic providing excellent additional space and storage\r\nLarge private rear garden\r\nSuperb Classes Lake location"
      },
